                  <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFCore.AdditionalProperty"/>
                  <body>schema:PropertyValue in the AdditionalProperty role - a key/value extension property carrying a propertyID (property name) and a value, optionally with a unit. Used wherever schema:additionalProperty appears. See CDIFDiscoveryImplementationGuide.md (Polymorphism of PropertyValue) for the distinction from Identifier.</body>
               </ownedComment>
               <name>AdditionalProperty</name>
